## Summary

**Vulnerable Code Location:**
- `test/encoder/impd_drc_user_config.c`, lines 40-72

**Root Cause:**
Missing bounds checking in string parsing loops that search for ':' delimiter

**Reachability:**
✅ **CONFIRMED REACHABLE** - Called from testbench during DRC config file parsing

**Recommended Fix:**
```c
while (line[i] != ':' && i < sizeof(line) - 1) {
    c++;
    i++;
}
if (i >= sizeof(line) - 1) {
    // Handle error: delimiter not found
    return 0.0f; // or appropriate error value
}
```
